<title>USA: CBOT muni bond trade resumes after halt.</title>
<headline>CBOT muni bond trade resumes after halt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading on Chicago Board of Trade's municipal bond contract resumed after being halted Wednesday at approximately 0830 EST due to technical problems, according to a spokeswoman for the exchange.</p>
<p>&quot;There was an issue with the price reporting terminal,&quot; the spokeswoman explained.</p>
<p>--Kathie O'Donnell, 212-859-1655</p>
</text>
